# screenshot parity-gate captures are transient and must NOT be committed — post-lift "after" sets,
# imgdiff diff PNGs, and ad-hoc /tmp/demo-* dumps. shots/ above already covers the after/diff sets the
# scripts write there. The ONE tracked exception is the pre-lift golden baseline (the pre/post parity
# reference), so ignore everything under baselines/ EXCEPT baselines/prelift/.
/baselines/*
!/baselines/prelift/
